  "status": "present",
  "value": "expression uses variables (runs of lowercase letters), \"+\", \"-\" and parentheses, with no spaces. A \"-\" may also appear as a unary sign at the start of the expression or right after \"(\"; otherwise operators are binary. Return the equivalent expression with all parentheses removed: every variable in its original order with its effective sign, joined by \"+\" and \"-\", where the first term has no sign when positive and a leading \"-\" when negative. Like terms are not combined.",
